<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Data raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Data raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Wednesday it had raised its rating for First Data Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Boston information transaction processing company closed at 35-1/4 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
